'''Gummy Cat''' (グミネコ, ''Gumi Neko'', '''Gummy Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

