==Enemy==
This enemy acts pretty much as a variant of [[Ms. Sign]], but with more health and (consequently) more knockbacks. It has the same movement speed as [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] and deals only 1 damage.

==Strategy==
This enemy can easily be beaten by using fast attacking cats such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]]. However, do note that this route may take a long time due to Gummy Cat's many knockbacks.

