==Trivia==
*Gummy Cat has the highest amount of knockbacks out of all enemies in the game, with 100,000. The second is [[Ms. Sign]] with 10,000, and the third is [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 1)]] at 8,000.
*This enemy is based on one of the gummies in a bag of Battle Cats gummy candy, actually sold in Japan, as seen above.

